1
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:19,720
The weather is so nice today.

2
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:33,120
Yeah, it's really nice.

3
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:51,160
Hey, everything is fine
at the hospital now.

4
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:52,400
I want to go see Pang.

5
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:53,320
Do you know where he lives?

6
00:00:53,320 --> 00:00:55,520
The leftmost room on the 3rd floor,
404 Changlin Road.

7
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:56,800
Okay, I'll go find him.

8
00:00:56,800 --> 00:00:58,960
Xiao, the weather is nice today.

9
00:00:58,960 --> 00:00:59,720
Go talk to him.

10
00:00:59,720 --> 00:01:00,680
Cheer him up.

11
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:02,480
Don't let him look so miserable.

12
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:05,800
How did he know Pang was crying?

13
00:01:12,320 --> 00:01:13,560
Pang, open the door.

14
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:14,560
It's me, Xiao Han.

15
00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:16,160
I don't want to live anymore.

16
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:18,400
Why?

17
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:19,880
I'm all alone again.

18
00:01:19,880 --> 00:01:20,800
What are you doing?

19
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:21,930
I don't want to live.

20
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:26,560
Are you crazy?

21
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:28,360
I had a very long dream.

22
00:01:28,520 --> 00:01:29,280
I dreamed about

23
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:30,320
my childhood.

24
00:01:30,320 --> 00:01:32,759
And a girl who was really nice to me.

25
00:01:32,800 --> 00:01:34,660
She risked her life to protect me.

26
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:39,200
Easy, you're scratching your skin off.

27
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:43,080
But when I woke up,
I realized it was all fake.

28
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:45,200
No one in this world loves me at all.

29
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:47,000
It's all fake.

30
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:06,600
Warning. Extreme sadness detected.

31
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:08,400
City's perfection compromised.

32
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:10,000
Executing emotional purge.

33
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,360
Emotional purge.

34
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:13,000
Go talk to him.

35
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,000
Cheer him up.

36
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,800
Don't let him look so miserable.

37
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:48,800
We didn't return to reality at all.

38
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:51,000
This is still an instance of the system.

39
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:51,880
And

40
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:54,560
this instance doesn't allow
any extreme emotions.

41
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:57,280
Otherwise, it triggers the purge program

42
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:58,520
and you get wiped out by the system,
just like now.

43
00:02:58,520 --> 00:02:59,400
Is that so?

44
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:01,720
But there are no missions here.

45
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:03,280
And no pain to feel.

46
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:06,800
How great is that?
If this is the reality we want,

47
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:08,800
why wake up?

48
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:54,600
Abnormal emotions have disappeared.

49
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:55,800
Alert canceled.

50
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:05,000
Hello, Mr. Xiao.

51
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:06,200
I am the Shepherd.

52
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,610
Please don't be afraid.

53
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:10,400
In this tailor-made world without pain,

54
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:13,360
you no longer have to bear
the burden of any emotions.

55
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,890
This is a gift from a friend.

56
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:16,120
Who is he?

57
00:04:19,399 --> 00:04:21,000
Someone who loves you very much

58
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:22,600
and wants to protect you.

59
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:25,420
He only wants you to be happy forever.

60
00:04:56,320 --> 00:04:58,440
Perfect Reality Instance Mission.

61
00:04:58,440 --> 00:05:00,400
Please maintain absolute
happiness and smile

62
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:02,360
in this painless world

63
00:05:02,400 --> 00:05:03,720
to live a perfect life.

64
00:05:04,880 --> 00:05:06,680
You clear the game
when you completely forget sadness

65
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:07,880
and learn to be happy

66
00:05:07,880 --> 00:05:08,800
forever.

67
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:18,400
I received a black envelope last night.

68
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,850
We didn't return to reality at all.

69
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:22,680
This is still a system instance.
